 "captions": [
  {
   "t0": 0.195,
   "t1": 1.455,
   "text": "Half the distance.",
   "line": "ch3_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 1.475,
   "t1": 3.12,
   "text": "Now the ocean moves.",
   "line": "ch3_hook"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.268,
   "t1": 8.008,
   "text": "Half the distance: about one hundred ninety-two thousand kilometers.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 8.028,
   "t1": 11.508,
   "text": "The Moon now looks twice as wide as it does tonight.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.528,
   "t1": 15.558,
   "text": "Tides come from the difference in the Moon's pull across the Earth.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.578,
   "t1": 18.898,
   "text": "That difference falls off with the cube of the distance.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.918,
   "t1": 23.428,
   "text": "So half the distance means about eight times the tidal force.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.448,
   "t1": 26.217,
   "text": "Here is the idea, not a measured height:",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 26.237,
   "t1": 29.653,
   "text": "the water at your feet starts to climb the beach.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.673,
   "t1": 33.368,
   "text": "Slowly, in long swells, hours at a time.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 33.388,
   "t1": 37.218,
   "text": "The waterline reaches the dry sand, and keeps going.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.238,
   "t1": 40.713,
   "text": "Imagine the foam line creeping up toward your feet.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 40.733,
   "t1": 44.032,
   "text": "It is a slow, patient rise, as if the whole",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.052,
   "t1": 46.753,
   "text": "ocean were being lifted from above.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 46.773,
   "t1": 50.533,
   "text": "The Moon is no longer a calm light in the sky.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 50.665,
   "t1": 52.823,
   "text": "Real quick: like and subscribe,",
   "line": "cta3_subscribe"
  },
  {
   "t0": 52.843,
   "t1": 55.935,
   "text": "if space just got a little stranger for you.",
   "line": "cta3_subscribe"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.091,
   "t1": 57.896,
   "text": "It is something that pulls.",
   "line": "ch3_vo"
  },
  {
   "t0": 58.104,
   "t1": 60.824,
   "text": "And the night itself is about to change.",
   "line": "ch3_loop"
  },
  {
   "t0": 60.953,
   "t1": 62.233,
   "text": "Part three of eight.",
   "line": "closer3"
  },
  {
   "t0": 62.253,
   "t1": 64.063,
   "text": "Full video on YouTube.",
   "line": "closer3"
  }
 ],
